# R1188-U21 dependency summarization corpus. The cached Wikipedia intros of
# data/benchmarks/web-formalization/ (every page, every language) and the
# issue bodies listed below, which the requirement extraction benchmark caches
# under data/benchmarks/issue-requirements/ (the first thirty by issue number
# when this list was written). An issue body is read as prose: fenced code,
# tables, block quotes, HTML tags and link targets are left out.
dependency-summarization-corpus
  pages "data/benchmarks/web-formalization"
  issue "data/benchmarks/issue-requirements/issue-1.md"
